    'global.methodology_title': 'How the Global Score Is Calculated',
    'global.methodology_text': 'The global safety score is the arithmetic mean of all country safety scores in our database. Each country\'s composite score (1-10) is computed daily from multiple public data sources. The global score provides a benchmark for contextualizing individual country scores.',
